# Backup archives. A 14MB zip of an unrelated project was committed here
# once already; keep the next one out of the tree.
*.zip

# The GLB validation contact sheets. Diagnostics of a build artefact,
# regenerated in seconds by scripts/gear-3d/validate-glb.mjs, and a folder of
# renders beside public/pedals would read as though the site served them.
scripts/gear-3d/validation/

# The Blender master. `ds1.py` IS the source and rewrites this on every run, so
# a committed copy is a 1MB binary that churns on every build and is the one
# that goes stale, exactly like the collector's committed bundle. Open it
# locally by running the script; the GLB it exports is the shipped artefact and
# that one is committed, the same way public/pedals is.
*.blend
*.blend1

# Godot writes its import cache and extracted materials inside the project; see
# godot/rig-room/.gitignore for which of them are settings and which are cache.
